<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Taxpayer Statement Regarding Refund</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin: 0;">Form 3911</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">(October 2022)</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Department of the Treasury - Internal Revenue Service</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">OMB Number</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">1545-1384</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Taxpayer Statement Regarding Refund</h2>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">The information below is in reply to your inquiry on <span data-field="date_of_inquiry">{{ date_of_inquiry }}</span> about your Federal tax refund for</p>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">If you did not receive your refund or if the refund check you received was lost, stolen or destroyed, complete the entire form. If there are portions of the form that do not apply to you, you may mark them as N/A. Return to us in the envelope provided or fax the form to</p>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;"><strong>Note:</strong> You must complete a separate Form 3911 for each refund for which you are requesting information.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;"><strong>Note:</strong> If you are in possession of a check which was not cashed within one year of the issue date as the law requires, it can no longer be cashed, contact the service for instructions on how to return your check.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">For information on how to complete or where to send this form, visit <a href="#" style="color: #0000EE;">www.irs.gov/forms/pubsub-form-3911-taxpayer-statement-regarding-refund</a>.</p>

  <h3 class="section-header" style="font-size: 12pt;">Section I</h3>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">1. Your name</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 70%;">
        <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 25%;">
        Taxpayer Identification Number
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 3px; height: 15px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">2. Spouse's name (if a name is entered here, spouse must sign on line 11)</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 70%;">
        <span data-field="spouse_full_name">{{ spouse_full_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 25%;">
        Taxpayer Identification Number
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 3px; height: 15px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">3. Current address</p>
    <table style="font-size: 11pt;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Apt. No.</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">City</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">State</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">ZIP code</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">4. Name(s)</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Give us a phone number where you can be reached between 8 a.m. and 4 p.m. Include area code.</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 40%;">
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">5. Name of representative</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Address on return if different from current address</p>
    <table style="font-size: 11pt;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Apt. No.</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">City</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">State</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">ZIP code</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">6. Address (include ZIP code)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">If you authorized a representative to receive your refund check, enter his or her name and mailing address below.</p>

  <h3 class="section-header" style="font-size: 12pt;">Section II</h3>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">7. Type of return</p>
    <table style="font-size: 11pt;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Individual</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Business</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Form</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Other</td>
        <td style="width: 40%;">Tax period</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Type of refund requested</p>
    <table style="font-size: 11pt;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Check</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Direct Deposit</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Refund amount $</td>
        <td style="width: 40%;">Date filed</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Name of bank (where you normally cash or deposit your checks)</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Account type</p>
    <table style="font-size: 11pt;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Checking</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Saving</td>
        <td style="width: 10%;">Other</td>
        <td style="width: 40%;">Account number</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Bank RTN</p>
    <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="section-header" style="font-size: 12pt;">Section III</h3>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">8. I didn't receive a refund.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">I received a refund check, but it was</p>
    <table style="font-size: 11pt;">
      <tr>
        <td><input type="checkbox"> Lost</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"> Stolen</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"> Destroyed</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">9. I received the refund check and signed it.</p>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;"><strong>NOTE:</strong> The law doesn't allow us to issue a replacement check if you endorsed it and someone other than you cashed the check, since that person didn't forge your signature.</p>

  <h3 class="section-header" style="font-size: 12pt;">Certification</h3>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">Sign below. If this refund was from a joint return, both spouses must sign, before we can begin a trace.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">Under penalties of perjury, I declare that I have examined this form, and to the best of my knowledge and belief, the information is true, correct, and complete. I request that you send a replacement refund, and if I receive two refunds, I will return one.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">10. Signature (for business returns, signature of person authorized to sign the check)</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 70%;">
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 25%;">
        Date
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px; margin-top: 3px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">11. Spouse's signature, if required (for businesses, enter the title of the person who signed above)</p>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 70%;">
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 25%;">
        Date
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; height: 15px; margin-top: 3px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Catalog Number 41167W</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">www.irs.gov</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Form 3911 (Rev. 10-2022)</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>